  "strategy": "baseline",
  "base_year": 2022,
  "forecast": [
    {
      "year": 2023,
      "revenue_cr": 1208.23,
      "net_income_cr": -1369.78,
      "eps": -6.51
    },
    {
      "year": 2024,
      "revenue_cr": 940.37,
      "net_income_cr": -1066.13,
      "eps": -5.07
    },
    {
      "year": 2025,
      "revenue_cr": 731.86,
      "net_income_cr": -829.72,
      "eps": -3.95
    }
  ],
  "reasoning": "From the Consolidated P&L, Total Revenue from Operations was \u20b92,066.36 Cr in FY2021 and \u20b91,552.22 Cr in FY2022, implying a YoY revenue decline of approximately -24.9%. Net Income (PAT attributable to the group, i.e., Profit/(Loss) for the period) was -\u20b91,911.58 Cr in FY2021 and -\u20b91,761.20 Cr in FY2022, a improvement of ~7.87% (loss reduction); however, projecting forward using the FY2022 revenue growth rate of -24.9% for revenues and applying the same -24.9% rate to net losses (i.e., losses also shrink by ~24.9% each year in line with the shrinking balance sheet). Shares outstanding as of FY2022 stand at approximately 2,102.99 Cr shares (face value \u20b910 each, consistent with basic EPS of -\u20b98.71 reported on consolidated basis using 1,831.34 Cr net loss attributable to equity holders / ~210.3 Cr shares \u2014 actually cross-checking: -1,831.34 / -8.71 \u2248 210.26 Cr shares); EPS is computed as net income attributable to equity holders divided by ~210.26 Cr shares, projecting net income at the same -24.9% revenue decline rate applied to the -\u20b91,761.20 Cr FY2022 consolidated PAT figure."
}

Step 1: Identify the 3 most critical assumptions embedded in this forecast.
Step 2: For each assumption, describe one plausible scenario where it fails.
Step 3: Rate each assumption failure as Low / Medium / High risk to the forecast accuracy.
Step 4: Assign an overall confidence score from 0-100 (100 = completely certain).

RESPONSE FORMAT: Begin your response DIRECTLY with the opening brace { — no reasoning or text before the JSON.

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "company": "<COMPANY>",
  "base_year": <YYYY>,
  "strategy": "<baseline|alt_strategy>",
  "assumptions": [
    {"assumption": "<text>", "failure_scenario": "<text>", "risk": "<Low|Medium|High>"}
  ],
  "confidence_score": <0-100>,
  "overall_critique": "<2 sentences>"
}

